+# Perf history
+
+## Real transcript ingest
+
+No measured figures for ingesting this project's own real Claude Code transcript
+were found in this repository or in the available session records.
+
+What exists instead:
+
+- `crates/muninn-capture/src/lib.rs` has a smoke test
+  (`smoke::parses_real_transcripts_when_present`) that, when a transcript is
+  present under `~/.claude/projects/-home-ilien-Projects-muninn`, parses it and
+  prints turn/episode/tool counts to stderr. It does not record file size in MB
+  or wall-clock ingest time, and no output from a run of this test is checked
+  into the repo.
+- `research/00-evidence-log.md` and `design/ENGINE.md` record ingest timings
+  from a different, synthetic benchmark (200 generated records ingested into a
+  50,000-record index: ~80 ms to ingest plus ~195 ms for the subsequent
+  `optimize`). That is not a measurement of ingesting this project's own real
+  transcript, so it is not reported here.
+
+Since no real-transcript ingest was actually run and measured (size in MB,
+turn count, episode count, elapsed time), those numbers are left unfilled
+rather than invented. Fill in this section after running the ingest against a
+real transcript and recording the actual output.
